# [STIR](../wg/stir.html)

## Summary

The STIR Working Group met at IETF 127. The session included updates on document status, presentations on telephone number domain binding (`tn-domain-binding`) and Vesper, a strawman proposal for SIP/RTP certificates, and a new proposal for agent identification in STIR. A adoption poll was taken for `tn-domain-binding` and `vesper`, which will be taken to the mailing list for further discussion due to a high number of "no opinion" responses.

