## Decisions and Action Items

* **TN Domain Binding & Vesper Adoption:** The call for adoption of `tn-domain-binding` and `draft-ietf-stir-vesper` will be brought to the working group mailing list for further discussion due to the poll results.
* **SIP/RTP Certificates:** Chris Wendt will refine the strawman proposal based on feedback (specifically removing SDES and addressing DTLS-SRTP fingerprint binding) for further collaboration on the list.
* **STIR for Agents:** Discussion will continue on the mailing list to refine the draft scope and determine if charter updates are necessary.